p.src:
At this point the lecture is ready for its explicit verdict: $\text{consumer uses of genetic engineering}
\Longrightarrow
\text{morally impermissible}.$ What matters is the order in which Sandel arrives here. He does not begin with condemnation. He earns it through the opening case, the widening class of borderline interventions, the logic of selection, the cryobank example, and the analysis of parental responsibility.

